From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:50:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] psDooM: processes as monsters, through libpsd

psDooM's hooks on Crispy Doom, calling the shared glue in
engines/common/psdoom (psdoom-plus tree) and libpsd. Generated with
tools/apply-doom-hooks.py; same hook set as the Chocolate patch.
---
 src/doom/d_main.c   |  3 +++
 src/doom/g_game.c   |  4 ++++
 src/doom/m_menu.c   |  4 ++--
 src/doom/p_inter.c  | 12 ++++++++++++
 src/doom/p_mobj.c   |  4 +++-
 src/doom/p_mobj.h   |  7 +++++++
 src/doom/p_saveg.c  |  4 ++++
 src/doom/p_setup.c  |  4 ++++
 src/doom/p_tick.c   |  2 ++
 src/doom/r_defs.h   |  5 +++++
 src/doom/r_things.c | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 11 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

